nprolog
------------------------------------------
Interpreter and compiler to be compatible with Arity/Prolog32

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libncurses-devel-6.5+20240427-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/sasagawa888/nprolog

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/sasagawa888/nprolog/archive/refs/tags/v5.20.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack nprolog-5.20-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./nprolog-5.20-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/nprolog-5.20-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/nprolog-5.20-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

